<section class="py-10 bg-white"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4"><p class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-ember mb-3">С плотом на Дону</p><h2 class="font-extrabold text-river-deep text-xl md:text-2xl mb-6" style="text-wrap:balance">Как это выглядит: <span class="mark-yellow">трофеи, плот, коптильня, костёр</span></h2><div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-3"><figure class="aspect-[3/4] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-100"><img src="https://rostur.expert/assets/img/3463ee01-fb3b-4a7f-be55-a2ec2ffbc2f6-15917327.webp" alt="Судак с плота на Дону — трофей ростовского рыбака" width="600" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-105 transition"></figure><figure class="aspect-[3/4] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-100"><img src="https://rostur.expert/assets/img/41bee1e5-c0c2-4d21-984b-e58b7e85084e-16582868.webp" alt="Плот Бульбусик на воде у меловых гор" width="600" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-105 transition"></figure><figure class="aspect-[3/4] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-100"><img src="https://rostur.expert/assets/img/2d2a920c-1ba8-47f4-8f5f-ca884bd334d7-15917195.webp" alt="Коптильня горячего копчения на борту плота" width="600" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-105 transition"></figure><figure class="aspect-[3/4] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-100"><img src="https://rostur.expert/assets/img/91b9146d-3f34-40e4-8247-c6156c521649-15767499.webp" alt="Вечерний костёр и уха после рыбалки" width="600" height="800" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-105 transition"></figure></div></div></section>
